t navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"334058954c4841707a48645e47cd97c6130254ee06241c789bb64f75a65a3407\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"42bf06a52a5197e71c5d906da6fae1e3ec82abec82953250d5f469e99b21e533\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actor plays alongside real life wife husband unrelated characters show\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_9869a0ed587641e79b123386"},{"content":"The clue about \"plays alongside a real-life relative though unrelated in the series\" combined with \"character married more than 2 but less than 5 times\" and \"only one child survives\" is very specific. Let me think about this differently. The \"real-life relative\" could be a parent, child, or sibling. Let me search for a more specific combination, possibly involving a long-running series that started between 2000-2020.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"character married three times one surviving child long running series\", \"actor real life daughter son plays unrelated character same show\", \"character married four times one child survives drama series\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_498d089af87349b19864af0f","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... Every woman who gets involved with Nate Romanowski - the series' resident badass - meets an untimely end.\\n\\n- The Cat Who... Series: Supporting character Iris Cobb was married three times, and all three of her husbands predeceased her — her first one (and the father of her only son) died of ... \",\"title\":\"htt